      "$comment": "The Nordics this pack actually contains. It listed IS and asked for 5, so the single gold tier was unreachable by one country — invisibly, because a set has no ceiling to declare and nothing checked that its members exist. Iceland is a content decision: adding it means a flag, an outline, a capital, a currency and a location, all sourced. Until somebody does that, the set is the four that are here."
